    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Located in the heart of Lifford Town is this very well maintained terraced townhouse. Internally presented in first class condition with the present owners having carried out substantial refurbishment works in recent years. Ground floor accommodation comprises of a sitting room, dining room, kitchen and bathroom with two double bedrooms on the first floor and two further bedrooms in the attic area. Featuring PVC framed double glazed windows throughout, oil fired central heating plus car parking space at the rear, this house is ready for the next owners to move in their furniture and enjoy."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Four bedroom terraced townhouse<br><br>\nEntrance Hallway - 6.6m x 1.0m <br>Tiled floor.\nCarpeted stairs to first floor.\nPlaster coving.\n3 stem ceiling light.<br><br><br>\nSitting Room - 3.3m x 3.2m <br>Open fireplace with back boiler.\nTiled floor.\nFront facing window with blinds.\nPlaster coving.\n3 stem ceiling light.\n2 wall lights.<br><br><br>\nDining Room - 3.3m x 3.0m <br>Tiled floor.\nContains hot press.\nDoorway from hall.\nDoorway leading into kitchen.<br><br><br>\nKitchen - 2.5m x 2.3m <br>Galley style kitchen.\nHigh and low level kitchen units on two walls.\nStainless steel sink.\nElectric oven.\nGas hob.\nChrome extractor fan.\nFloor tiled.\nWalls tiled between units.\n<br><br><br>\nBack Hall - 2.6m x 0.9m <br>Tiled floor.\nPlumbed for washing machine.\nPartly shelved.\nPVC back door.<br><br><br>\nBathroom - 2.7m x 1.6m <br>WHB, WC & electric shower.\nFloor and walls fully tiled.\nGrosflex ceiling.\nStorage under wash hand basin.\nLighted mirror over wash hand basin.\nChrome heated towel rail.\nBuilt in vanity unit.\n<br><br><br>\nBedroom One - 4.5m x 3.1m <br>Built-in wall to wall wardrobe unit.\nTwo windows to front with blinds.\nLaminate timber floor.<br><br><br>\nBedroom Two - 3.0m x 2.8m <br>Window to rear with vertical blind.\nLaminate timber floor.<br><br><br>\nBedroom Three - 4.5m x 3.1m <br>Front facing dormer window.\nLaminate timber floor.\nRestricted ceiling height.<br><br><br>\nBedroom Four - 3.0m x 2.8m <br>Velux window.\nLaminate timber floor.\nRestricted ceiling height.<br><br>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Town centre location.\nPVC framed double glazed windows.\nOil fired central heating.\nOak doors on the ground floor rooms."
      },
